From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] package: add Airoha NPU LuCI dashboard

Vendor the upstream luci-app-airoha-npu dashboard at commit
5c6e9e079ad9ecb1446c674e964f797842675856. Enable the package in the HG5585F
profile and expose the read-only PPE accounting fields used by the existing
HG5585F validation and diagnostics.

Signed-off-by: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
---
